  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Albania Air Quality Alignment Project (AQA) 2026-2027 SwEPA/SMHI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anpassning av Albaniens regim f&#xf6;r luftkvalitet (AQA) 2026&#x2013;2027 SwEPA/SMHI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ej tillg&#xe4;nglig</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unavailable</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective is: Government of Albania decides on assessment regime including defined zones and decision on data management system and budgets.

This is to be achieved by the following secondary objectives (per project component):

1. Strengthened capacity for decision-making on National Assessment Regime at MoE and NEA in accordance with revised AAQ Directive.

2. Strengthened capacity for selection and readiness for set-up of national data hosting system at NEA.

3a. Enhanced capacity for reporting in accordance with NEC Directive and LRTAP Convention.

3b. Increased capacity for Emissions Inventory and dispersion modelling</narrative>
  </description>
